<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57325" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιγκλ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, mostly in pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιγκλίδες</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>latticed gates</i> in the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικαστήριον</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλευτήριον</span>, by which the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικασταί</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλευταί</span> were admitted to pass through the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρύφακτοι</span> or bar, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				641
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				124
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥητορεία κιγκλίδων
				ἐπιδέουσα καὶ βήματος</span> requiring <i>the practice
				of the bar</i> and the assembly, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.975c
			</span></i>: sg., <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				12.38
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντὸς τῆς κ. διατρίβειν</span>
			live <i>in court</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ διαλεκτικαὶ κ.</span> logical
				<i>quibbles</i>, behind which one ensconces oneself, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				330c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>any latticed gates,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1668.65
			</span></i> (sg.), <i><span class="en">
				3.162
			</span></i> pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρύφακτοι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				68
			</span></i>: sg., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> prob.
				= Lat. <i>fidiculae</i>, an instrument of
			torture, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				20
			</span></i>.</div>
